{{CURRENTYEAR}}、元日。<br>
家への帰り道、ボクは悩んでいた<br>
{{CURRENTYEAR}}, New Year's Day. <br>
On the way back home, I was worried.

「にゃんこ大戦争」を<br>
見守り続け<br>
もう何年になるだろうか？<br>
キミ達は一向に<br>
ボクを呼んでくれやしない<br>
How many years have passed since<br>
I started watching over<br>
"[[Nyanko Daisensou|The Great Cat War]]"?<br>
You guys never<br>
call me at all.

天上天下…唯我独尊…<br>
…地上最強…豪華絢爛<br>
最終兵器…神様最高…<br>
In the heavens above and below the heavens... I alone am exalted...<br>
...The greatest on Earth... luxurious and gorgeous<br>
The ultimate weapon... God Supreme...

どんな言葉を並べても<br>
このボクの偉大さは語れない<br>
No matter what words I use,<br>
I cannot express how great I am.

そんなパーフェクトなボクだから<br>
みんな遠慮してるんだろう？<br>
Is it because I'm so perfect that<br>
everyone shies away from me?

でも<br>
このボクは気づいちゃったんだ！<br>
But<br>
I noticed!

捧げるネコカンが高すぎた<br>
ってことに！<br>
The [[Cat Food]] cans offered were too expensive.<br>
That's what I mean!

メンゴ、メンゴ（笑）<br>
Sorry, sorry (laughs)

あ、そうそう<br>
最近セレブに人気の<br>
宇宙旅行に行ってきたんだけど<br>
Ah, yes,<br>
I recently went on a <br>
cosmic tour popular among celebs.

そこには宇宙のエリートを<br>
名乗るエイリアンたちがいて<br>
彼らはすごく輝いてたんだ<br>
There were Aliens there<br>
who claimed to be the cosmic elite,<br>
and they were shining brilliantly.

神さまの口からは到底言えない<br>
…あんな場所まで輝いている<br>
エイリアンもいた<br>
You couldn't possibly have heard that from [[The Cat God (Special Cat)|God]]'s mouth.<br>
...There were also Aliens<br>
shining all the way over there.

まぁ所詮ボクの輝きには<br>
到底及ばなかったんだけれどね！<br>
Well, in the end, they were nowhere near<br>
as brilliant as I!

旅先ではそう、どこへ行っても<br>
「キャーキャー」言われちゃって<br>
ボクの偉大さを隠しきれずに<br>
迷惑かけちゃったことは反省してる<br>
Wherever I went during my trip,<br>
I would hear chattering.<br>
I couldn't hide my greatness.<br>
Sorry for being a nuisance.

「なぜ裸なの？」っていうのも<br>
よく聞かれたけど<br>
何言ってるかわからなかったな<br>
I was often asked,<br>
"Why are you naked?",<br>
but I didn't know what they were talking about.

あ！<br>
Ah!

今さ、目をキラキラさせて<br>
宇宙に飛び出してきたにゃんこ達と<br>
すれ違って思い出したんだけど<br>
I just remembered that I passed by the Cats<br>
who flew out into space,<br>
their eyes gleaming.

キミ達に、言っておかないと<br>
いけないことがあったんだ<br>
There was something I needed<br>
to tell you guys.

これから現れる<br>
「エイリアン」も、<br>
そんなに悪いやつらじゃないよ♪<br>
どこかで見たことあるやつばかりだけどね<br>
The "Aliens" that will appear from now on,<br>
they're not so bad either♪<br>
Just a certain guy who's already been seen somewhere before, though.

というわけで、<br>
「にゃんこ大戦争」宇宙編の、<br>
はじまりはじまり〜〜！<br>
And so,<br>
the Cosmos Arc of "The Great Cat War"<br>
has begun...!
